==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|вотъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|ото}} or {{m|orv|вото}}, compare with {{cog|pl|oto}} and {{m|pl|ot}}, {{cog|uk|от}} and {{m|uk|ото}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-вот.ogg}}
* {{ru-IPA|vət}} {{q|rarely when unstressed}}
* {{ru-IPA|vɐt}} {{q|rarely before a stressed syllable}}
* {{homophones|ru|вод}} (only when stressed)
* {{rhymes|ru|ot|s=1}}

===Particle===
{{head|ru|particle}}

# {{n-g|Used in place of a pronoun to direct attention towards something}}; [[this]] (is), [[here]] (is), [[that]] (is), [[there]] (is)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[мой]] [[дом]].|t='''This'''/'''here''' is my house.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Во́т''' [[где]].|t='''This is'''/'''here's''' where.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Во́т''' [[в]] [[что|чём]] [[вопро́с]].|t='''That is''' the question.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[и]] [[всё]].|t=[[that's all|'''That's''' all]].}}
# {{n-g|Used before; both before and after; or (less commonly) after a pronoun or adverb to direct attention towards a particular thing being shown, pointed to, indicated, etc.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[взвесьте|Взве́сьте]] [[мне]] '''вот''' [[э́той]] [[ветчины́]], [[пожа́луйста]].|Weigh me this ham, please.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[так]] [[обы́чно]] [[вы́глядят]] [[общежи́тия]].|That's how dormitories usually look.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[ду́маю]], [[что]] '''вот''' [[э́то]] '''вот''' [[о́чень]] [[краси́вое]].|I think ''this'' one is really pretty.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вы|Вы]] '''вот''' [[та́к]] '''вот''' [[позво́лите]] [[ему́]] [[уйти́]]?|You're just going to let him walk away like that?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[итак|Ита́к]], [[э́ти]] '''вот''' [[я́блоки]]...|So, ''these'' apples...}}
# {{n-g|Used before a full sentence to describe a scene unfolding before one's eyes.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[он]] [[бежать|бежи́т]], [[подпрыгнуть|подпры́гнул]], [[приземлиться|приземли́лся]].|He's now running, he jumps, he lands.}}
# {{n-g|Used as a lead-in, often when introducing an example}}; [[so]], [[now]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[наприме́р]]...|t='''So''' for instance...}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[е́сли]]..|'''Now''', if...}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[ска́жем]]...|'''So''' let's say...}}
# {{lb|ru|often with {{m|ru|и}}}} {{n-g|Used before a statement to draw attention to a conclusion or result}}; [[so]], [[that's why]]
#: {{syn|ru|'''вот''' [[почему́]]|поэ́тому}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[слы́шал]] [[об]] [[э́том]], '''вот''' [[и]] [[интересу́юсь]].|I heard about that, '''that's why''' I'm interested.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вчера|Вчера́]] [[э́той]] [[фу́нкцией]] [[злоупотребля́ли]], '''вот''' [[и]] [[запрети́ли]].|They abused that function yesterday, '''so''' it was banned.}}
# {{n-g|Used in set phrases.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[тебе́]]/[[вам]] [[и]]...|[[so much for|So much for]]...}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вот как|'''Во́т''' как]]?|[[oh really|Oh really]]? (with a tone of irony or distrust)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот''' [[ты|тебе́]] [[раз]]!|t=[[there you are|'''There''' you are]]!}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} {{n-g|Used to express emphasis or strong emotion}}; [[what]] [[a]], [[such]] [[a]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Во́т''' [[челове́к]]!|t='''What a''' man!}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} {{n-g|Used as a filler word, usually between statements.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Вот'''... / [[так|Так]] '''во́т'''...|(depending on the context) So yeah... / So... / Now... / Right... / Anyway...}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ну|Ну]] '''во́т''', ...|(depending on the context) Well then, ... / Well, '''anyway'''...}}

